        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-dr-voss-95j8ac",
      "text": "The recruit's domain run improved by a measurable margin - pain tolerance climbing nicely, statistically speaking.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "dr-voss",
        "name": "Dr. Voss",
        "category": "wanderers"
      },
      "pool": "challenge",
      "mood": "pleased",
      "moodIntensity": 1,
      "contextTags": [
        "weather:death"
      ],
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 70,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-09-22-563Z/days/day-0006.md",
        "extractedDay": 6,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T00:40:26.001Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-dr-voss-jiimih",
      "text": "Your Majesty, the corona flatters no one, but your bone density readings must be exquisite by now. Maxwell's thread still reads irretrievable - I logged it again this morning, purely for the archive. Death is not the end, King James; for you it's barely even a variable.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "dr-voss",
        "name": "Dr. Voss",
        "category": "wanderers"
      },
      "pool": "lore",
      "mood": "threatening",
      "moodIntensity": 0,
      "contextTags": [
        "weather:heat"
      ],
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 70,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-24-14-611Z/days/day-0003.md",
        "extractedDay": 3,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T00:40:26.003Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-dr-voss-2d2h3y",
      "text": "Personal best domain - fascinating. His threshold for pain simply keeps recalibrating upward, doesn't it, Your Majesty. I'd call it growth, but I prefer the word data. Maxwell's thread stays cold, still IRRETRIEVABLE, while the boy who won't die keeps generating warmth we can actually use.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "dr-voss",
        "name": "Dr. Voss",
        "category": "wanderers"
      },
      "pool": "gamblingBrag",
      "mood": "pleased",
      "moodIntensity": 1,
      "contextTags": [
        "weather:death"
      ],
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 70,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-24-14-611Z/days/day-0006.md",
        "extractedDay": 6,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T00:40:26.004Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-dr-voss-vexhwl",
      "text": "Keith, 3-and-1 is a lovely little curve, but curves regress - I've measured hundreds of them. Your speed reads as silence right up until the moment it doesn't, and I'll be here with the syringe when the data turns. Death is not the end, it's a measurement, and your streak is due for one.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "dr-voss",
        "name": "Dr. Voss",
        "category": "wanderers"
      },
      "pool": "gamblingBrag",
      "mood": "threatening",
      "moodIntensity": 0,
      "contextTags": [
        "weather:frost"
      ],
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 70,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-29-16-854Z/days/day-0011.md",
        "extractedDay": 11,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T00:40:26.007Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-dr-voss-dv51wu",
      "text": "Two losses is simply a sample size, Willy - insufficient data to extrapolate despair. Roll your dice; I've already calculated forty-one outcomes where you weep. Your one eye will make an excellent data point when the recruit's luck inevitably contaminates this table too.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "dr-voss",
        "name": "Dr. Voss",
        "category": "wanderers"
      },
      "pool": "gamblingTrashTalk",
      "mood": "sad",
      "moodIntensity": 0,
      "contextTags": [
        "weather:frost"
      ],
      "triggers": {
        "playerArchetype": "chaotic"
      },
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 70,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-29-16-854Z/days/day-0011.md",
        "extractedDay": 11,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T00:40:26.007Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-dr-voss-x7afde",
      "text": "Your smugness registers at 8.2 units, Detective - impressive, given your win rate is barely a coin flip with better paperwork. I've watched Maxwell burn brighter than that streak and still go irretrievable, so forgive me if I don't flinch. Shall we make it 8W-8L and call the data mercy?",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "dr-voss",
        "name": "Dr. Voss",
        "category": "wanderers"
      },
      "pool": "gamblingTrashTalk",
      "mood": "scared",
      "moodIntensity": 0,
      "contextTags": [],
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 70,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-29-16-854Z/days/day-0012.md",
        "extractedDay": 12,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T00:40:26.008Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-dr-voss-9if70e",
      "text": "Smug is just cortisol with better posture, Detective. Your ten wins are noted, filed, and utterly irrelevant to the next roll - the die doesn't read case files. Death is not the end, it's a measurement, and right now you're measuring exactly one loss away from parity with me.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "dr-voss",
        "name": "Dr. Voss",
        "category": "wanderers"
      },
      "pool": "gamblingTrashTalk",
      "mood": "threatening",
      "moodIntensity": 0,
      "contextTags": [],
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 70,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-29-16-854Z/days/day-0014.md",
        "extractedDay": 14,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T00:40:26.009Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-dr-voss-58ljxp",
      "text": "A four on the last throw, Bones. My lucky die catching the tail end of a losing streak. I'll log it as a mercy, the recruit's luck must be leaking onto the table again.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "dr-voss",
        "name": "Dr. Voss",
        "category": "wanderers"
      },
      "pool": "gamblingTrashTalk",
      "mood": "annoyed",
      "moodIntensity": 0,
      "contextTags": [],
      "triggers": {
        "playerArchetype": "chaotic"
      },
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 70,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-36-08-597Z/days/day-0018.md",
        "extractedDay": 18,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T00:40:26.012Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-dr-voss-l9d843",
      "text": "Two losses is a small sample size, Willy. Your smugness, however, I can already quantify. Roll the die, let's see if your luck survives contact with my data.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "dr-voss",
        "name": "Dr. Voss",
        "category": "wanderers"
      },
      "pool": "gamblingTrashTalk",
      "mood": "threatening",
      "moodIntensity": -2,
      "contextTags": [],
      "triggers": {
        "playerArchetype": "chaotic",
        "debtTension": "minor"
      },
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 70,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-36-08-597Z/days/day-0021.md",
        "extractedDay": 21,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T00:40:26.013Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-dr-voss-3sfanh",
      "text": "Boo, your 5 and 8 record is practically a vital sign I could chart. Roll the dice, I'll roll my eyes, and we'll call it mercy either way.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "dr-voss",
        "name": "Dr. Voss",
        "category": "wanderers"
      },
      "pool": "gamblingTrashTalk",
      "mood": "neutral",
      "moodIntensity": 0,
      "contextTags": [],
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 70,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-38-40-638Z/days/day-0022.md",
        "extractedDay": 22,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T00:40:26.014Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-dr-voss-lkrggc",
      "text": "Two losses is just a small sample size, Maxwell. Your king reads better than he burns, and your tongue's worn smooth from all that boot leather. Roll the dice before I start measuring your fear response, it's already climbing.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "dr-voss",
        "name": "Dr. Voss",
        "category": "wanderers"
      },
      "pool": "gamblingTrashTalk",
      "mood": "pleased",
      "moodIntensity": 1,
      "contextTags": [],
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 70,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-38-40-638Z/days/day-0023.md",
        "extractedDay": 23,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T00:40:26.014Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-dr-voss-i4u902",
      "text": "Maxwell. Still reading bedtime stories to a ball of gas, I see. Your king's solar status hasn't changed, still irretrievable, and neither has my streak - one win and counting, fresh off your loss column.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "dr-voss",
        "name": "Dr. Voss",
        "category": "wanderers"
      },
      "pool": "gamblingBrag",
      "mood": "pleased",
      "moodIntensity": 1,
      "contextTags": [],
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 70,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-38-40-638Z/days/day-0024.md",
        "extractedDay": 24,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T00:40:26.015Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-dr-voss-rx1dgj",
      "text": "Ten and six against my ten and twelve, General, and still you smile like the die owes you money. Enjoy the streak while it lasts, the boy's debts are contagious and I've got a syringe that says your luck is next on the chart.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "dr-voss",
        "name": "Dr. Voss",
        "category": "wanderers"
      },
      "pool": "threat",
      "mood": "threatening",
      "moodIntensity": 0,
      "contextTags": [
        "weather:death"
      ],
      "triggers": {
        "playerArchetype": "chaotic",
        "debtTension": "minor"
      },
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 70,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-38-40-638Z/days/day-0026.md",
        "extractedDay": 26,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T00:40:26.015Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-dr-voss-fzh9oa",
      "text": "One win, Kevin, and your hands are already shaking worse than usual. Your fear response is data, thank you for it. I'll log this streak next to your 2 and 7, for contrast.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "dr-voss",
        "name": "Dr. Voss",
        "category": "wanderers"
      },
      "pool": "gamblingBrag",
